      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T17:48:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fair points! I agree, there\u0027s nothing wrong with a HAL being \"too accepting\".\n\nThough, realistically, I would expect an SE to have strict limits due to memory concerns. So we should probably remove this test.",
      "parentUuid": "7810fa0f_2a9001ab",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 756,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 756,
        "endChar": 20
      },
